  "title": "Kawa Yakitori",
  "description": "This crispy chicken skin (kawa) yakitori recipe threads strips of fatty skin onto skewers and cooks them for a crispy yet juicy Japanese-style appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Buckwheat Queen"
  ],
